        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-5",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Positional vertigo"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Vertigo for months, increased over the last 2 weeks; triggered by rolling in bed, looking up, or lying flat, especially to the right. Room-spinning episodes last a few seconds and less than 30 seconds, and settle when the head is still. Similar to previous episodes."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-6",
